config VIDEO_MTK_CAM
	tristate "MediaTek camera pipeline core"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV && MEDIA_CONTROLLER && OF
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	select VIDEO_MTK_SENINF
	select VIDEO_MTK_CAMSV
	help
	  The camera pipeline of MediaTek SoCs is a chain of subdevices - the sensor on its I2C
	  bus, the CSI-2 receiver (SENINF) and the capture engine (CAMSV) - described by the device
	  tree graph. This core owns the shared media device and the v4l2 device the others
	  register into, and creates the pad links between them.
